=========================================================================

This software is a landing-tier bridge that runs an unmodified Arcade and
merkle-service broadcaster stack with a multicast delivery fabric as its
transport. It terminates subtree and block delivery lanes, caches each
object, and announces it to merkle-service with a retrieval URL served by
this software, so that pushed bytes reach the stack through its ordinary
announce-fetch path. A propagation facade accepts Arcade's outbound
transaction broadcasts, hydrates them to Extended Format, and forwards
them to fabric ingress. Neither Arcade nor merkle-service is modified:
no patched ingest, no additional RPC, and no change to validation.

