Interoperability

This software interoperates with Arcade and merkle-service over their
published network interfaces only: Arcade submits transactions to the
facade over the data hub HTTP contract, and merkle-service consumes
Kafka announcement topics and fetches announced content over HTTP from
the retrieval endpoint. It does not incorporate, link, or redistribute
any Arcade or merkle-service source code. The message contracts it needs
are reproduced from their wire definitions:

  Arcade
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/arcade

  merkle-service
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/merkle-service

